{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/455864-chariot","id":455864,"title":"Chariot","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-24T08:49:02-07:00","id":455864,"title":"Chariot","content":"Hi, remember me?<br /> <br /> So I'm working on (another) fantasy roleplaying game ruleset. I'm documenting my progress, some of my art, and some of the ideas about why I've picked the systems I have. In the summer it's going to be kickstartered, but right now I'm looking for playtesters and engagement.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://chariotrpg.blogspot.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://chariotrpg.blogspot.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://chariotrpg.blogspot.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://chariotrpg.blogspot.co.uk/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Here's the pitch:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i>Five million years this place has been here, and now, the Twin Continents reach their final equilibrium, their final setting for the coming catastrophe, and let us not be mistaken, the catastrophe will come. The warring Emperors of the Atlanteans, South and North, who can be told apart by their flags alone, Black and White respectively, draw their lines.<br /> <br /> The life flows from the ground, the hairline cracks grow wider; the coastlines recede from the sea. It doesn't have to happen. Humanity can still be saved, will endure. Our actions as part of a people in danger will determine the course of the next age. Peace or chaos, slavery or freedom? What cards have we drawn? What role will we play?<br /> </i><br /> An ongoing tabletop role-playing game project by Howard David Ingham, contributor to Vampire: the Requiem 2nd edition, Changeling: the Lost, Promethean: the Created and a veritable stack of other role-playing games and books for White Wolf and Onyx Path. He also worked on The Black Seal and Worlds of Cthulhu, and his self published MSG\u2122.<br /> <br /> In Chariot, players take on the roles of the men and women of Atlantis and the Lost Lemuria, who are destined by forces outside of their knowledge to decide the fate of the world to come after the coming catastrophe. Their names will be forgotten, but their legacy is the future. They will love and hate for the fate of the world.<br /> <br /> Where will you stand in the face of the coming wave? </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4413-frances-best-friend","name":"Frances' Best Friend","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4413_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}